Subject: [PATCH] OCCT 8.0.0 compatibility (SMESH / Geom / NETGENPlugin / Netgen)

Rebased from the upstream OCCT 8.0.0 compatibility work by the SMESH
maintainer (oursland/SMESH, branch occt-8.0.0, PR looooo/SMESH#2):
patch/{Geom,SMESH,NETGENPlugin,Netgen}_occt800.patch, with the per-patch
subdirectory roots folded into the paths so the combined patch applies
with -p1 at the source root. The four bundled Netgen src/Netgen/libsrc/occ
files whose upstream hunks assume earlier Netgen patches not present in
this release tarball are handled separately in the next patch.

Re-ported to SALOME SMESH, KERNEL and GEOM V9_16_0 by pySMESH. Every hunk applies at
fuzz 0. Changes from the conda-forge text:

* Dropped, because pySMESH never stages these files: the NETGENPlugin and Netgen
  sections (NETGEN is not built) and SMESH_MeshVSLink.hxx (not in SMESH V9_16_0).
* StdMeshers_Cartesian_3D.cxx no longer includes Bnd_B3d.hxx; V9_16_0 moved the
  include to StdMeshers_Cartesian_3D_Grid.hxx, which gets the same Bnd_B3.hxx change.
* The same OCCT 8.0 pass on the code that is new in V9_16_0:
  - SMESH_ControlsClassifier.hxx: Bnd_B3d.hxx -> Bnd_B3.hxx;
  - SMESH_ControlsClassifier.cxx: include TopTools_IndexedMapOfShape.hxx, which OCCT 8
    headers no longer pull in;
  - SMESH_RegularGrid.hxx: TopTools_ListIteratorOfListOfShape.hxx -> TopTools_ListOfShape.hxx;
  - StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx: iterate a const TopTools_ListOfShape by const reference;
  - GEOMUtils::ProjectPointOnFace and GEOMUtils::DistanceToProjectionOnFace: five
    ::Raise() calls become throw (OCCT 8 removed Standard_Failure::Raise).

